1. COA A - Concentrated Attack
   - blue-bridgehead: move to (9,6), attack red-riverline
   - blue-screen: move to (10,6), support_by_fire red-riverline
   - blue-support: move to (8,6), hold

2. COA B - Secure Flank and Attack
   - blue-bridgehead: move to (8,6), attack red-riverline
   - blue-screen: move to (7,6), hold
