Implementing Concentration and Surprise doctrines, we will maneuver our forces to create a bridgehead across the river at hex (10,6). COA A concentrates combat power at the decisive point, attacking the red-riverline with a combined force. COA B secures our flank and maintains an observing element to gather intel on the enemy town, providing flexibility to adjust our maneuvers as necessary.

